<title>UK: World Bank sets $200 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets $200 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     5.5	 MATURITY    27.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  L-22.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME, NOT 144A</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
